From: volodymyr-holovan <285621215+volodymyr-holovan@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 21:49:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] Final Castle: tell players how to get into the gazebo

Text above the gazebo's spawner, the player's next step when they come up to the
gazebo or click a force field of the castle, a message on entering the castle, and
tooltips for the Talisman of the Cube and the Cube of Annihilation.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
